## note

The build rewrites two version-controlled files (`next-env.d.ts`, `tsconfig.json`).
They are reverted after the build; they are not part of this delivery.
`apps/studio/package-lock.json` is generated by the install and is not tracked by
this delivery (the lockfile policy belongs to ATS-102).

The TypeScript step passing means the UID types added to
`apps/studio/lib/api.ts` (`Project.uid`, `TestDef.uid`/`uidSource`/`uidStable`,
`Run.uid`/`seq`/`projectUid`/`attempts`, `Attempt`) are consistent with the
components that consume them.
